{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01567","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第一拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第一拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉室将衰兮四夷不宾，动干戈兮征战频。\n哀哀父母生育我，见离乱兮当此辰。\n纱窗对镜未经事，将谓珠帘能蔽身。\n一朝虏骑入中国，苍黄处处逢胡人。\n忽将薄命委锋镝，可惜红颜随虏尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}